Table build:

```java
private static byte[] buildTable(String symbols, double[] probs) {
    int m = symbols.length();
    double[] cum = new double[m];
    double c = 0.0;
    for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {
        c += probs[i];
        cum[i] = c;
    }
    byte[] table = new byte[IM];
    for (int s = 0; s < IM; s++) {
        double r = (double) s / IM;
        int j = 0;
        while (j < m - 1 && cum[j] <= r) j++;
        table[s] = (byte) symbols.charAt(j);
    }
    return table;
}
```

